this is intended to be a custom client that replaces the World of Warcraft 3.3.5a client.

It should load the proprietary assets and interface with azerothcore.

it should have feature parity with the default client.

this client will just handle things like UI, sound, display of 3d models and
effects, loading the terrain, applying full-screen overlay effects, accepting
input, rebinding keys, running addons, handling the networking between the
client and azerothcore, the login and loading screen process, opening UI windows
and interacting with various character sheets and buttons and such, and sending
chat messages correctly. Users should be able to join parties, raids, and guilds
and other such things. It should in all respects be exactly the same as the
official client, just written from scratch with my paradigms in the design.

It is not the same program. It loads the same assets, it accomplishes the same
tasks, but it's architecture behind the scenes will be vastly different.

It is not a product. It won't be sold. When the assets are replaced, then the
server, client, and assets will be fully open-source, and the game can blossom,
free from the intellectual property rights that restrict it's growth.
